  NSIS 3.11, https://nsis.sourceforge.io/

  Copyright (c) 1999-2021 Nullsoft and Contributors, and others named in the
  project's licence file. zlib/libpng licence, except:

    Source/7zip/*  (the LZMA compression module)  Common Public License 1.0,
      with a special exception from Igor Pavlov and Amir Szekely that
      "expressly permit[s] you to statically or dynamically link your code (or
      bind by name) to the files from the LZMA compression module for NSIS
      without subjecting your linked code to the terms of the Common Public
      license version 1.0". Rations uses the module unmodified, via
      `SetCompressor /SOLID lzma`, so the exception applies and no CPL
